 "bio": {
  "lang": "en",
  "script": "Latn",
  "text": "I am the founder of ETAN COMICS, a Panafrican publishing company helping kids connect with their African heritage through exciting comics & graphic novels. I am also a writer. Most people know me from being the creator of the first Ethiopian Superhero comic book series, JEMBER and HAWI. I am passionate about sharing Ethiopian history"
